  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SOLANAOASIS v2.0.6\n\nConnects the OASIS to Solana -- capable of 65,000+ transactions per second with sub-second finality and sub-cent fees. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, NFTs, and token data on Solana programs. Ideal for high-frequency OASIS data workloads. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture -- switch providers at runtime, zero code changes. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.5\n- Initial validated package contents and metadata for this release line.\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SOLANAOASIS",
